<title>UK: Lufthansa cargo factor off 0.6 pts at 67.9.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa cargo factor off 0.6 pts at 67.9.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG saw its cargo load factor slip 0.6 points to 67.9 percent in June compared to June last year.</p>
<p>In its half-yearly traffic report the airline reported the Jan-Jun load factor ran a similar 0.7 pts down on last year at 67.4 percent.</p>
<p>Details of Lufthansa's first half year traffic figures included:</p>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo		  June 97  Pct change  Jan-June  Pct change</p>
<p>						  vs June 96    1997    vs H1 '96</p>
<p>Cargo Load factor(pct)	   67.9   down 0.6 pts   67.4   down 0.7 pts</p>
<p>Available CTK's(million)	781     down 2.2	4,590   up 1.0</p>
<p>Revenue CTK's(million)	  531     down 3.0	3,092   down 0.1</p>
<p>Number of flights	    11,946     up  16.8     70,210   up 16.3</p>
<p>Cargo/Mail(000) tns	     137.6   down 1.9	812.4   down 0.4</p>
<p>Europe Cargo/Mail(000)tns	60.4   down 1.0	363.5   down 2.4</p>
<p>America Cargo/Mail(000)tns     39.0   up   4.5	220.1   up 4.0</p>
<p>Asia/Pac. Cargo/Mail(000)tns   34.3   down 6.0	201.5   down 0.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
